Package: musr
Title: MusicXML Parsing and Musical Analysis Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sam", "Barnette", , "sam.barnette2024@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for parsing MusicXML files and computing musical features including pitch, contour, roughness, harmonicity, and diatonic deviation. Includes functions for time-based slicing, metric aggregation, and visualization of musical structure.
